  "periods":[{"period_id":"vol-03","volume":"vol-03","time":"本卷","name":{"zh":"武侦法第九条","en":"Butei Law Article 9"},"aliases":["武侦不得杀人原则"],"type":"social","description":"武侦不论在任何情况下，都不得在武侦活动中杀害任何人。本卷中该原则是明里改造间宫杀人技与救起夹竹桃的核心规范。","principles":"武侦活动必须以逮捕、制压和救助为目标，即使对象是敌人也不可放任死亡。","classification":"legal/ethical rule","levels":[],"known_practitioners":["akari","aria","shino","tsuzuri-umeko"],"origin":"武侦法","limitations":["实战中会与杀人技、强敌压迫和搏命行动冲突"],"related_systems":["butei-charter","butei-rank-exam-system"],"evidence_level":"S","source_refs":["hidan-no-aria-aa/vol-03/full.txt"]}],"source_refs":["hidan-no-aria-aa/vol-03/full.txt"]}
